# Coverage reports. NOT just build noise: istanbul's HTML embeds the full
# SOURCE of every file it covers, including src/examples/local/*, which is
# gitignored precisely because it must never be published. A `git add -A`
# after a --coverage run put twelve of those on GitHub.
coverage/
*.lcov
*.log

